    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1495">

                <pb facs="1126" n="1010" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1010"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.404/35.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Hostetter to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Hermosillo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 15, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Abusing of nuns and priests. Absolutely nothing of said character ever has
                    happened in this entire district either during nineteen [omission] or before.
                    Neither were ever outraged or property abused. One only expatriated, accused of
                    political campaigning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hostetter</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
